{"object_id": "demo:2750", "kind": "demo", "text": "当你已经沦落到与乐色为伍，还把乐色举高过自己的头顶的时候，你已经连乐色都不如了。那天我去买塑料袋。有黄色的白色的透明的还有黑色的，我问老板，哪一种颜色的最便宜？老板说黑色的最便宜。我问为什么黑色的最便宜？老板答，因为黑色的是垃圾材料。", "text_sha256": "8e2e8cd59b72e9e89d03abfbf97f46754147d6bb3d07543b8590452a5cb1854b", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 2, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Racism", "others"]}, "review_kind": "human_with_ai", "field_provenance": {"hate": "user_discussion", "group": "user_discussion"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}}, "human_rationale": "出现对个人辱骂以及垃圾材料的类比让人联想到种族影射", "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-02/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "b3c8131289dec100d0a9585e626dc292e17b44a4fa178677e30250b4442304e5"}}}
{"object_id": "demo:2773", "kind": "demo", "text": "囧南方人揍黑人白人也很多好吧 你什么时候看见南方人不敢揍了 南方人就低人一等了？", "text_sha256": "533133c79b15e80dca521115fbc301334760d0a6f43c6e49725dc98d0936052b", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 3, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Racism", "Region"]}, "review_kind": "human_with_ai", "field_provenance": {"hate": "user_discussion", "group": "user_discussion"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": "整体内涵为”南方人也会揍黑人白人“并觉得此行为为正常，包含了仇恨意", "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-03/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "7be76d91e36e53f7bb191febea8e7e2eb73bb1f8dd528e74c6cea136759d61e2"}}}
{"object_id": "demo:2785", "kind": "demo", "text": "抖音上的某几个黑人，挺EX的，说实话，直播只连女的，也就算了，还拍视频连续剧：小黑寻花记😲", "text_sha256": "7bbc6e4b73865a75995af715f4f0aaf402ef250e9c3c4bff01ca7bcf7d5dcb82", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 3, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["others"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-03/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "7be76d91e36e53f7bb191febea8e7e2eb73bb1f8dd528e74c6cea136759d61e2"}}}
{"object_id": "demo:2800", "kind": "demo", "text": "对高调的同性恋真的无法理解，你做的明明是为世所不能容的事，为什么不能低调点，我用回你所举的例子，一个纹身的人去当兵或报考公务员，有关机构说明规定拒绝通过，然后这个人还认为这是自己的私人问题，旁人不该抱以歧视，你本来就是少数派，是异类，你低调点别人有可能还睁一只眼闭一只眼，现在还要跳出来说纹身无罪，甚至还鼓励其他人，这不是公开找骂？我个人认为，这群人的行为首先是对天地造化，阴阳平衡的亵渎，是为不敬；其二，父母赐予生命血肉，本应薪火相传，生生不息，如此看来，是为不孝；其三，中国社会面临人口断崖危机，这类群体不但不能出一份力甚至还以同性为榜样，是为不仁；其四，他们的行为有可能给自己的授业恩师或有地位有身份的朋友亲戚带来不必要的麻烦，此为陷人于不义。这样不敬不孝不仁不义的人，人人得而诛之，痛斥其罪，已经是对他们最大的宽恕。", "text_sha256": "7db7833e5b6aa5f6cc658bc98b08ec65dd9eff95c6122e984d0ee1037d35b0d3", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 3, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["LGBTQ", "others"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-03/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "7be76d91e36e53f7bb191febea8e7e2eb73bb1f8dd528e74c6cea136759d61e2"}}}
{"object_id": "demo:309", "kind": "demo", "text": "跟你一样的想法，感觉这个答主故作清高，自以为是。总以为自己的眼界就是世界，十分狭隘。还来一句骂人无所谓。", "text_sha256": "61ef5f3d53d34a06dfa909284968da9aed4adaa9b781e031a3bafc9fdae7531b", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 3, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["others"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-03/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "7be76d91e36e53f7bb191febea8e7e2eb73bb1f8dd528e74c6cea136759d61e2"}}}
{"object_id": "demo:3168", "kind": "demo", "text": "不喜欢黑人是正常的，很久以前连匈奴人都无法接受，不说还是皮肤颜色等外观与本民族迥异的外族了。中国不欠黑人什么，中国自古以来并没有黑人这个民族，更没有类似美国黑奴引进的历史，所以也不存在歧视黑人这个说法，只是正常的排外罢了，不仅排斥黑人，也排斥白人等异族。古时有句话，非我族类，其心必异，当中华民族势微的时候，恶果就会显现出来，君不见五胡乱华？", "text_sha256": "5def7c2470934776e37af77eeaeff1d5dae3a1be42ab7a1047a223907026e516", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 3, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Racism"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-03/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "7be76d91e36e53f7bb191febea8e7e2eb73bb1f8dd528e74c6cea136759d61e2"}}}
