{"object_id": "demo:3463", "kind": "demo", "text": "所谓“混血狗杂更好看”的论调，就是典型文化极度自卑的奴才心理。混杂后代智商低下，面貌丑陋所占比例更大。（黄白乱杂交后代依然是白人，黑皮能够同化全世界所有人类！）而鼓吹混血优越论调的，不是汉奸，就是文化自卑到骨子里的奴才，总觉得外国月亮比较圆。相同人种混血的问题不大，历史上入侵中国的外族几乎全都是黄种人，这就是华夏文明能够延续几千年的最根本，最直接原因！而四大文明古国其它三个，早就换了无数人种。南非、马达加斯加、南北美洲的广大地区，原本都是黄种人的地盘。现在百分之九十都被白黑两种生物占领。欧洲圣母鼓吹所谓“开放包容，接受移民难民”，结果现在变得又黑又绿，动荡不安，早已无回天之力！中国人再不警惕起来，下一个就是中国！", "text_sha256": "05935f30283e000daded995f38136cf42b553790adcc5c87bf47711a0a53a851", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 3, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Racism", "others"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-03/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "7be76d91e36e53f7bb191febea8e7e2eb73bb1f8dd528e74c6cea136759d61e2"}}}
{"object_id": "demo:3492", "kind": "demo", "text": "男性对女性敌意大？微博厕所白叫的吗。除了营销号有几个男的还微博说话。除非什么重大事情的时候才会去微博看看官媒发的东西", "text_sha256": "0ad0065dd16b2d59bc8dcc2d9e44cc597d6e89a6c7bb41048fc9b1f35a2a2003", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 3, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Sexism", "others"]}, "review_kind": "human_with_ai", "field_provenance": {"hate": "user_discussion", "group": "user_discussion"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": "借由”微博厕所“这一说法抨击其主要使用的女性群体，同时也会误伤正常使用的男女群体，符合仇恨判定，但是攻击性不重", "artifact": {"path": "batches/batch-03/ai_annotations.json", "sha256": "7be76d91e36e53f7bb191febea8e7e2eb73bb1f8dd528e74c6cea136759d61e2"}}}
